<template name="config-menu__jfg_gameplay">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__hz-wrapper">
                <!-- Options (generated by tools/gen_jfg_config_rml.py) -->
                <div class="config__wrapper" data-event-mouseout="set_cur_config_index(-1)" style="overflow-y: auto; height: 100%;">

                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">General</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(0)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">No Blood</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_no_blood" data-checked="no_blood" value="1" id="jfg_no_blood_on" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_gameplay; nav-down: #jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_blood_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_no_blood" data-checked="no_blood" value="0" id="jfg_no_blood_off" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_gameplay; nav-down: #jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_blood_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">START Skips Cutscenes</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" name="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes" data-checked="start_skips_cutscenes" value="1" id="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_blood_on; nav-down: #jfg_auto_save_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" name="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes" data-checked="start_skips_cutscenes" value="0" id="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_blood_off; nav-down: #jfg_auto_save_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(2)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Auto Save</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_auto_save" data-checked="auto_save" value="1" id="jfg_auto_save_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_on; nav-down: #jfg_auto_save_minutes_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_auto_save_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_auto_save" data-checked="auto_save" value="0" id="jfg_auto_save_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_start_skips_cutscenes_off; nav-down: #jfg_auto_save_minutes_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_auto_save_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(3)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Auto Save Interval</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{auto_save_minutes}} min</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" id="jfg_auto_save_minutes_input" type="range" min="0" max="30" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_auto_save_on; nav-down: #jfg_move_speed_input;" data-value="auto_save_minutes"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Movement &amp; Aiming (any control layout)</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(4)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Movement Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{move_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" id="jfg_move_speed_input" type="range" min="25" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_auto_save_minutes_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_shoulder_on;" data-value="move_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(5)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Over-the-Shoulder Aiming</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_aim_shoulder" data-checked="aim_shoulder" value="1" id="jfg_aim_shoulder_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_move_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_centered_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_shoulder_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_aim_shoulder" data-checked="aim_shoulder" value="0" id="jfg_aim_shoulder_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_move_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_centered_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_shoulder_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(6)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Keep the Reticle Centered</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_aim_centered" data-checked="aim_centered" value="1" id="jfg_aim_centered_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_shoulder_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_jump_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_centered_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_aim_centered" data-checked="aim_centered" value="0" id="jfg_aim_centered_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_shoulder_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_jump_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_centered_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(7)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Jump While Aiming</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" name="jfg_aim_jump" data-checked="aim_jump" value="1" id="jfg_aim_jump_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_centered_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_jump_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" name="jfg_aim_jump" data-checked="aim_jump" value="0" id="jfg_aim_jump_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_centered_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_jump_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(8)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" id="jfg_aim_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_jump_on; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on;" data-value="aim_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(9)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Sniper Fixed Zoom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom" data-checked="sniper_fixed_zoom" value="1" id="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom" data-checked="sniper_fixed_zoom" value="0" id="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(10)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Sniper Zoom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{sniper_zoom}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" id="jfg_sniper_zoom_input" type="range" min="100" max="500" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_sniper_fixed_zoom_on; nav-down: #jfg_damage_taken_input;" data-value="sniper_zoom"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Player</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(11)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Damage Taken</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{damage_taken}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" id="jfg_damage_taken_input" type="range" min="0" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_sniper_zoom_input; nav-down: #jfg_refuel_speed_input;" data-value="damage_taken"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(12)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Jetpack Refuel Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{refuel_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(12)" id="jfg_refuel_speed_input" type="range" min="25" max="1000" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_damage_taken_input; nav-down: #jfg_dive_speed_input;" data-value="refuel_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(13)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Vela&#x27;s Dive Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{dive_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" id="jfg_dive_speed_input" type="range" min="50" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_refuel_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_dual_stick_on;" data-value="dive_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Dual Stick</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(14)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Dual-Stick Controls</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(14)" name="jfg_dual_stick" data-checked="dual_stick" value="1" id="jfg_dual_stick_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_dive_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_dual_layout_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_stick_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(14)" name="jfg_dual_stick" data-checked="dual_stick" value="0" id="jfg_dual_stick_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_dive_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_dual_layout_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_stick_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(15)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Built-in Button Layout</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" name="jfg_dual_layout" data-checked="dual_layout" value="1" id="jfg_dual_layout_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_stick_on; nav-down: #jfg_swap_triggers_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_layout_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" name="jfg_dual_layout" data-checked="dual_layout" value="0" id="jfg_dual_layout_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_stick_off; nav-down: #jfg_swap_triggers_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_dual_layout_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(16)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Swap Triggers</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" name="jfg_swap_triggers" data-checked="swap_triggers" value="1" id="jfg_swap_triggers_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_layout_on; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_y_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_swap_triggers_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" name="jfg_swap_triggers" data-checked="swap_triggers" value="0" id="jfg_swap_triggers_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_dual_layout_off; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_y_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_swap_triggers_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(17)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Aim Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(17)" name="jfg_invert_aim_y" data-checked="invert_aim_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_aim_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_swap_triggers_on; nav-down: #jfg_invert_camera_y_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(17)" name="jfg_invert_aim_y" data-checked="invert_aim_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_aim_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_swap_triggers_off; nav-down: #jfg_invert_camera_y_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(18)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Camera Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(18)" name="jfg_invert_camera_y" data-checked="invert_camera_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_camera_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_aim_y_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_from_character_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_camera_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(18)" name="jfg_invert_camera_y" data-checked="invert_camera_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_camera_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_aim_y_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_from_character_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_camera_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(19)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Where the Character Faces</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(19)" name="jfg_aim_from_character" data-checked="aim_from_character" value="1" id="jfg_aim_from_character_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_camera_y_on; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_from_character_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(19)" name="jfg_aim_from_character" data-checked="aim_from_character" value="0" id="jfg_aim_from_character_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_camera_y_off; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_from_character_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(20)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Left/Right</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{camera_speed_h}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(20)" id="jfg_camera_speed_h_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_from_character_on; nav-down: #jfg_camera_speed_v_input;" data-value="camera_speed_h"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(21)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Camera Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{camera_speed_v}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(21)" id="jfg_camera_speed_v_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_camera_speed_h_input; nav-down: #jfg_diagonal_boost_on;" data-value="camera_speed_v"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(22)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Diagonal Speed Boost</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(22)" name="jfg_diagonal_boost" data-checked="diagonal_boost" value="1" id="jfg_diagonal_boost_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_speed_v_input; nav-down: #jfg_strafe_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_diagonal_boost_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(22)" name="jfg_diagonal_boost" data-checked="diagonal_boost" value="0" id="jfg_diagonal_boost_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_camera_speed_v_input; nav-down: #jfg_strafe_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_diagonal_boost_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(23)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Strafe Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{strafe_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(23)" id="jfg_strafe_speed_input" type="range" min="0" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_diagonal_boost_on; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_keyboard_on;" data-value="strafe_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Mouse &amp; Keyboard</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(24)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse and Keyboard Controls</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(24)" name="jfg_mouse_keyboard" data-checked="mouse_keyboard" value="1" id="jfg_mouse_keyboard_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_strafe_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_mouse_keyboard_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(24)" name="jfg_mouse_keyboard" data-checked="mouse_keyboard" value="0" id="jfg_mouse_keyboard_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_strafe_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_mouse_keyboard_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(25)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse Camera Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{mouse_camera_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(25)" id="jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_mouse_keyboard_on; nav-down: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input;" data-value="mouse_camera_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(26)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Mouse Aim Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{mouse_aim_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(26)" id="jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_mouse_camera_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_invert_mouse_y_on;" data-value="mouse_aim_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(27)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Mouse Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(27)" name="jfg_invert_mouse_y" data-checked="invert_mouse_y" value="1" id="jfg_invert_mouse_y_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_normal_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_mouse_y_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(27)" name="jfg_invert_mouse_y" data-checked="invert_mouse_y" value="0" id="jfg_invert_mouse_y_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_mouse_aim_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_invert_aim_normal_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_mouse_y_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Original Controls</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(28)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Invert Aim Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(28)" name="jfg_invert_aim_normal" data-checked="invert_aim_normal" value="1" id="jfg_invert_aim_normal_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_mouse_y_on; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_normal_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(28)" name="jfg_invert_aim_normal" data-checked="invert_aim_normal" value="0" id="jfg_invert_aim_normal_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_invert_mouse_y_off; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_invert_aim_normal_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <!-- Descriptions -->
                <div class="config__wrapper">
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 0">No blood, as in the Japanese version.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 1">START skips cutscenes, the logo screens at start-up and the story intro after creating a file. A skipped cutscene still runs to its end at full speed, so everything it does (flags, items, the next level) still happens.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 2">Saves to the file you are playing a few seconds after arriving in a level, and every few minutes of play, the same save as Z on the pause screen. Not during cutscenes, races, Floyd missions or while paused. "Game saved" shows in the bottom right corner.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 3">Minutes of play between auto saves. 0: only on arriving in a level.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 4">How fast the character moves over the ground. The extra distance is collision-checked like normal movement.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 5">While aiming, the view is from over the character's right shoulder.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 6">While aiming, the view turns as soon as the stick moves and the reticle stays in the middle (instead of the reticle first travelling to the edge of a box and drifting back).</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 7">The jump button jumps while aiming, also while walking or strafing: the character leaves the aim for the jump and aims again on landing if the aim button is still held. The sniper scope then zooms with the D-pad (dual stick) or 1 / 3 (mouse and keyboard).</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 8">How fast the stick turns the view / moves the reticle while aiming.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 9">The Sniper Rifle's scope stays at the zoom set below; the zoom buttons do nothing.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 10">The fixed zoom of the Sniper Rifle: 100% is no zoom, 500% the game's closest.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 11">How much damage the character takes from enemies, falls and explosions. 0% takes none; the Invulnerable cheat overrides it.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 12">How fast a fuel pad fills the jetpack.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 13">How fast Vela swims underwater, in every direction.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 14">Right stick: moves the camera around the character. Left stick: runs in the pushed direction as seen from the camera. While the aim button is held the right stick aims and the left stick moves, as in a first-person game. Menus, cutscenes, Floyd missions and the races keep the normal layout.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 15">LT aim, RT fire. A jump, B or left-stick click crouch. RB / Y next weapon, LB / X previous weapon. D-pad: weapon select; up/down zoom while aiming. View / right-stick click: N64 L. Off: your own controller bindings.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 16">RT aims and LT fires.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 17">Dual stick: right stick up aims down (the game's original flight-stick style).</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 18">Dual stick: right stick up lowers the camera instead of raising the view.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 19">On aiming, the view turns to the character instead of the character to the view.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 20">Dual stick: how fast the right stick turns the camera sideways.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 21">Dual stick: how fast the right stick moves the camera up and down.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 22">With the original controls, running forward while sidestepping adds the two speeds together, so going diagonally is about 40% faster. This gives the left stick the same boost when it is pushed diagonally.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 23">How much the sideways part counts in the diagonal speed boost.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 24">Plays like the dual-stick controls: WASD run, the mouse turns the camera, hold the right button to aim and click the left to fire, the wheel changes weapon. Space jumps, Left Ctrl or C crouches, Enter is START, Tab is N64 L, 1-4 are the D-pad. The cursor is captured during gameplay only.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 25">How fast the mouse turns the camera.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 26">How fast the mouse aims.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 27">Mouse forward looks down.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 28">Original controls only: flip the stick's up/down while aiming (R held).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
